msgstr "Altn-läge: MANUELL"

msgid "Altn mode: AUTO"
msgstr "Altn-läge: AUTO"

msgid ""
"# Gesture Navigation\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar supports touch gestures on the map:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Swipe Up** (U): Zoom in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Swipe Down** (D): Zoom out\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Swipe Right** (R): Previous screen mode\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Swipe Left** (L): Next screen mode\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Up-Down** (UD): Auto zoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Down-Up** (DU): Menu\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Down-Right** (DR): Waypoint details\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Down-Left** (DL): Alternates\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Left-Up** (LU): Recently used waypoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Right-Down** (RD): Task manager\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Up-Right-Down** (URD): Analysis\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Left-Down-Right** (LDR): Checklist\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Up-Right-Down-Left** (URDL): Pan mode\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Left-Down-Right-Down-Left** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Up-Left-Down-Right** (ULDR): Quick menu\n"
"\n"
"Long-press on the map to enter Pan mode. Tap while in Pan mode to see nearby waypoints."
msgstr ""
"# Gestnavigering\n"
"\n"
"XCSoar stöder pekgester på kartan:\n"
"\n"
"- ![U](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UP) **Svep upp** (U): Zooma in\n"
"- ![D](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DOWN) **Svep ner** (D): Zooma ut\n"
"- ![R](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RIGHT) **Svep höger** (R): Föregående skärmläge\n"
"- ![L](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LEFT) **Svep vänster** (L): Nästa skärmläge\n"
"- ![UD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_UD) **Upp-ner** (UD): Autozoom\n"
"- ![DU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DU) **Ner-upp** (DU): Meny\n"
"- ![DR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DR) **Ner-höger** (DR): Vägpointdetaljer\n"
"- ![DL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_DL) **Ner-vänster** (DL): Alternativ\n"
"- ![LU](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LU) **Vänster-upp** (LU): Senast använda vägpoints\n"
"- ![RD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_RD) **Höger-ner** (RD): Uppgiftshanterare\n"
"- ![URD](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URD) **Upp-höger-ner** (URD): Analys\n"
"- ![LDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDR) **Vänster-ner-höger** (LDR): Checklista\n"
"- ![URDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_URDL) **Upp-höger-ner-vänster** (URDL): Panoreringsläge\n"
"- ![LDRDL](resource:IDB_GESTURE_LDRDL) **Vänster-ner-höger-ner-vänster** (LDRDL): Status\n"
"- ![ULDR](resource:IDB_GESTURE_ULDR) **Upp-vänster-ner-höger** (ULDR): Snabbmeny\n"
"\n"
"Långtryck på kartan för att aktivera panoreringsläge. Tryck i panoreringsläge för att se närliggande vägpoints."

msgid "Please enter four letters or digits only (ICAO station code)."
msgstr "Ange endast fyra bokstäver eller siffror (ICAO-stationskod)."

